WEBVTT

00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:20.250
Poyamba vidiyoyi ikusonyeza kutsogolo kwa diso kukaunikiridwa.

00:00:31.823 --> 00:00:51.823
Chithunzi chokulitsidwa chikusonyeza madontho achikasu pafupi ndi pakati pa retina.

00:01:03.647 --> 00:01:23.647
Chithunzi chikusintha pamene kuwala koyezera kukudutsa pa retina.
